# DataGrid

## Server-side first

- Lists backed by API pagination: pass `server={{ pagination, onPageChange, onLimitChange, isFetching }}` on `DataGrid`.
- Do not rely on client-only pagination for large datasets; client filters/sort are for small in-memory sets only.
- When adding server sort/filter: extend API + query params, then `server.onSortChange` / `server.onColumnFiltersChange` (see `DataGridProps`).

## Stability

- Use `EMPTY_COLUMN_FILTERS` (or stable empty object) — never `?? {}` per render on shared deps.
- Skip client `resetPage` effect when `useServerPagination` is true.

## Reuse

- Column defs in `*Table.tsx` next to route; shared behavior in `DataGrid`, `ListPagination`, `applyClientFilters`.
